Package: isoRouting
Title: Diagnostic Engine for Multivariate Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Joël R.", "Pradines", email = "joel.pradines@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a deterministic routing engine for multivariate time series anomaly detection. By extracting terminal node topology from Isolation Forests, the package bypasses Euclidean scaling artifacts to cluster anomalies using Hamming distance and hierarchical division. It includes methods to calibrate cluster integrity, extract topological medoids, and route streaming data into established historical archetypes.
